      "title": "vmware-hb: Handle zero length address",
      "message": "vmware-hb: Handle zero length address\n\nSome captures on my network showed this protocol with a zero\nlength IPv4 address string field (and no verification signature.)\nCheck for that to avoid a malformed error.\n",
